WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Move the pointer over a practice window

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Hold Super to reveal Tile, Minimize, Maximize/Restore, Close, and the gear

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The gear controls appearance and where these buttons are remembered

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Release Super to hide the controls; your apps keep running

